# Browser Integration Testing and Debugging Guide

## Overview
Use the comprehensive integration tests in `tests/integration/browser/` to debug game functionality. These tests provide a controlled environment to reproduce and isolate issues, with extensive browser automation and screenshot capabilities. Each test is now in its own file for better isolation and debugging.

**All browser tests are scenario-based** - they test realistic gameplay scenarios rather than isolated functionality. Generic tests have been removed in favor of meaningful scenarios that better represent actual user experiences.

